menu "Spotify Heart radar"

    config HR_PRINT_EXTRAS
        bool "Also print breath rate, distance and presence lines"
        default n
        help
            The Windows app only reads "heart_rate:" lines and ignores the
            rest, so these are safe to enable for bench work. Off by default
            so the default output matches the Arduino HeartRateOnly sketch.

    config HR_DUMP_FRAMES
        bool "Print every received frame as hex ('frame: 01 00 ...')"
        default n
        help
            Bench diagnostic used to capture test/fixtures/*.txt for the host
            parser tests (PLAN.md Phase 3). Leave off for normal use.

endmenu
